menu "Bestlink recorder"

config XVF_I2S_INPUT_RATE_HZ
    int "XVF3800 I2S input sample rate (Hz)"
    range 16000 48000
    default 16000
    help
        I2S clock rate generated by the ESP32-S3 for the XVF3800. The default
        matches Seeed's 16 kHz record/playback example. A 48 kHz input is
        downsampled to the required 16 kHz WebSocket PCM stream.

endmenu
